  {
   "text": "This is the family history of Esau",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.29,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "That is, Edom in the hill country of Seir",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 1.56,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "He took wives from the daughters of Canaan",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.87,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And moved away from his brother Jacob",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.76,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Chief Pinon stands in the list of names",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.07,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "A chief among the clans and regions",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.16,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "One of the leaders descended from Esau",
